# {{PROJECT_NAME}} Coding-Agent Instructions

This file is only for coding agents working in this repository. Human setup, testing, commit, and pull-request workflows live in [`DEVELOP.md`](./DEVELOP.md); project usage and navigation live in [`README.md`](./README.md).

## Authority

- Inspect repository-local contracts, schemas, tests, and instructions before editing.
- Keep stable interfaces in contracts or schemas, mechanically enforceable rules in validators, and workflow guidance in the appropriate agent instruction or skill.
- Update coupled implementation, tests, samples, and documentation in the same change.

## Safety

- Preserve unrelated user changes.
- Do not commit secrets, generated run artifacts, or environment-specific credentials.
- Do not bypass repository hooks or validators.

## Verification

- Run focused tests while iterating and the repository-defined full gate before completion.
- Report any environment-dependent validation that was not executed.
